<html>
    <head>
        <title>about ~ Slime Vault</title>
        <link href="style.css" rel="stylesheet">
    </head>
    <body>
        <%- include('nav.ejs', {current: 'about'}) %>

        <main class="page-layout">
            <section class="section-card">
                <h1>about this project</h1>
                <p>
                    Slime Vault is a nostalgia archive for the avid "slimers" like me,
                    those who used to use their recess time with their friends making slime using 
                    plastic containers and supplies brought from home to make slime in school during the slime craze.
                </p>
                <p>
                    the community board is public: submit a recipe, attach an optional image,
                    and it'll appear in the vault with your grade as a time-capsule marker
                </p>
                <p class="recipe-info">no accounts necessary, no irony, just a glittery history</p>
            </section>
        </main>
    </body>
</html>